request.description:
## Schema

### Request
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["email", "password"],
  "properties": {
    "email": { "type": "string", "format": "email" },
    "password": { "type": "string", "minLength": 6 }
  }
}
```

### Response 201
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["message", "data"],
  "properties": {
    "message": { "type": "string" },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "_id": { "type": "string" },
        "email": { "type": "string" },
        "createdAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
        "updatedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Auth: Bearer required

## Schema

### Params
- `id` (string, ObjectId) required

### Response 200
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["message", "data"],
  "properties": {
    "message": { "type": "string" },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "_id": { "type": "string" },
        "email": { "type": "string" },
        "createdAt": { "type": "string" },
        "updatedAt": { "type": "string" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Auth: Bearer required

## Schema

### Response 200
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["message", "data"],
  "properties": {
    "message": { "type": "string" },
    "data": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["locations", "services"],
      "properties": {
        "locations": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": { "type": "string" },
          "description": "Cities from active projects, e.g. cairo"
        },
        "services": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["construction", "infrastructure", "transportation"]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Auth: none

## Schema

### Query
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "locations": { "type": "string", "description": "cairo or cairo,giza" },
    "services": { "type": "string", "description": "construction,infrastructure,transportation" },
    "page": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "default": 1 },
    "limit": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 50, "default": 12 },
    "search": { "type": "string" },
    "isActive": { "type": "string", "enum": ["true", "false"], "description": "Admin token only" }
  }
}
```

### Response 200
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["message", "data", "meta"],
  "properties": {
    "message": { "type": "string" },
    "data": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": { "$ref": "#/ProjectListItem" }
    },
    "meta": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "page": { "type": "integer" },
        "limit": { "type": "integer" },
        "total": { "type": "integer" },
        "totalPages": { "type": "integer" },
        "filters": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "locations": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
            "services": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### ProjectListItem
```json
{
  "_id": "string",
  "name": "string",
  "slug": "string",
  "image": "string",
  "overview": "string",
  "date": "date",
  "address": "string",
  "location": "string",
  "client": "string",
  "contractValue": "string",
  "service": "construction|infrastructure|transportation",
  "isActive": "boolean",
  "createdAt": "date-time",
  "updatedAt": "date-time"
}
```

Frontend example: `/category/projects/?locations=cairo`

Auth: optional Bearer (to include inactive / filter isActive)

