request.description:
## Schema

### Request
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "name", "image", "overview", "date", "address",
    "location", "client", "contractValue", "service"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "name": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 200 },
    "slug": { "type": "string", "description": "optional; auto from name" },
    "image": { "type": "string", "format": "uri" },
    "overview": { "type": "string" },
    "date": { "type": "string", "format": "date" },
    "address": { "type": "string" },
    "location": { "type": "string", "description": "city lowercase, e.g. cairo" },
    "client": { "type": "string" },
    "contractValue": { "type": "string" },
    "service": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["construction", "infrastructure", "transportation"]
    },
    "isActive": { "type": "boolean", "default": true },
    "keyFeatures": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "image": { "type": "string" },
        "sections": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": ["title"],
            "properties": {
              "title": { "type": "string" },
              "value": { "type": "string" },
              "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Response 201
```json
{
  "message": "Project created successfully",
  "data": { "$ref": "#/Project" }
}
```

Auth: Bearer required

